{"document_id": "SYN-DOC-001", "title": "路灯故障巡检 SOP", "facility_type": "street_light", "content": "路灯报修应先确认设施编号、道路位置和是否存在裸露导线。夜间无法安全接近时应先隔离风险，再安排电气维修人员。", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "version": "synthetic-1.0", "source_type": "synthetic", "authority": "demo-only", "generator_version": "synthetic-v1", "generated_at": "2026-10-26T01:50:32.721745Z"}
{"document_id": "SYN-DOC-002", "title": "交通信号故障处置 SOP", "facility_type": "traffic_signal", "content": "交通信号灯故障应按路口重要性和是否影响通行判断优先级。涉及信号失控时应立即升级给交通设施值班人员。", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "version": "synthetic-1.0", "source_type": "synthetic", "authority": "demo-only", "generator_version": "synthetic-v1", "generated_at": "2026-10-26T01:50:32.721745Z"}
{"document_id": "SYN-DOC-003", "title": "道路坑洞维修 SOP", "facility_type": "road_surface", "content": "道路坑洞应记录位置、长度、宽度和深度。临近学校、医院或高速车流区域时提高风险等级，并先布置警示和临时隔离。", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "version": "synthetic-1.0", "source_type": "synthetic", "authority": "demo-only", "generator_version": "synthetic-v1", "generated_at": "2026-10-26T01:50:32.721745Z"}
{"document_id": "SYN-DOC-004", "title": "人行道破损处置 SOP", "facility_type": "sidewalk", "content": "人行道高差、塌陷和井盖缺失应记录照片和坐标。存在绊倒风险时先设置临时围挡，再安排维修。", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "version": "synthetic-1.0", "source_type": "synthetic", "authority": "demo-only", "generator_version": "synthetic-v1", "generated_at": "2026-10-26T01:50:32.721745Z"}
{"document_id": "SYN-DOC-005", "title": "排水设施巡检 SOP", "facility_type": "drainage", "content": "雨前巡检应清理雨水口和排水沟。积水超过阈值或影响主干道时应启动应急工单并通知调度人员。", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "version": "synthetic-1.0", "source_type": "synthetic", "authority": "demo-only", "generator_version": "synthetic-v1", "generated_at": "2026-10-26T01:50:32.721745Z"}
{"document_id": "SYN-DOC-006", "title": "公共厕所设施维护 SOP", "facility_type": "public_toilet", "content": "公共厕所报修需要区分供水、排水、照明和卫生问题。影响开放时应在工单中记录临时关闭和恢复时间。", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "version": "synthetic-1.0", "source_type": "synthetic", "authority": "demo-only", "generator_version": "synthetic-v1", "generated_at": "2026-10-26T01:50:32.721745Z"}
{"document_id": "SYN-DOC-007", "title": "工单关闭与验收规则", "facility_type": "general", "content": "工单关闭前必须有处理说明、完成时间和现场证据。高风险工单需要主管确认，返工工单不得直接标记为已完成。", "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "version": "synthetic-1.0", "source_type": "synthetic", "authority": "demo-only", "generator_version": "synthetic-v1", "generated_at": "2026-10-26T01:50:32.721745Z"}
